  "prompt": "For the products of the parent category Audio checked by Bliksem or by Stroomhuis from 3 to 9 March 2025, compare the two competitors' lowest prices. observed_ts holds UTC time: a check counts when its UTC date is in that week. Return four columns, in this order: product_name, bliksem_min_eur and stroomhuis_min_eur (the lowest price_eur each recorded for the product that week, missing when that competitor did not check it), and gap_eur, Stroomhuis's lowest minus Bliksem's lowest, missing when either is missing. Return one row for each Audio product checked by at least one of them that week. Any row order is fine.",
